			"widgets_values":[
				"Realistic live-action cinematic look, luxury romantic commercial trailer: practical film photography style, a futuristic premium metropolis at blue hour after rain, anamorphic lens, shallow depth of field, film grain, reflective rooftop surfaces, city volumetric haze, elegant flying-car traffic between towers, restrained grading for a premium blue-silver-gold feel, powerful natural movement.\nScene overview: on a rooftop in a post-rain futuristic city during Qixi Festival, a couple reunites in a brief, emotionally charged moment. The atmosphere is upscale, modern, romantic and cinematic, blending festival symbolism with a luxury-brand visual language.\nStoryboard (each shot a separate scene, clean rhythmic cuts, all timed to the musical beats):\n[0s-1.2s] Shot 1: wide rooftop shot: a woman in a flowing ivory dress stands near the rooftop edge, city lights reflecting in puddles around her, wind lifting the fabric, flying-car trails streaking softly between distant towers.\n[1.2s-2.5s] Shot 2: medium tracking shot: a man in a tailored dark coat approaches from behind through the rooftop mist, she senses him and turns, their eyes meet, the skyline glowing behind them.\n[2.5s-4s] Shot 3: close shot: he reaches out and gently takes her hand, the camera slightly circles them, the city haze and moving traffic creating soft bokeh in the background, the moment feels suspended in time.\n[4s-5s] Shot 4: final silhouette hold: they stand together facing the skyline, moonlight breaking through clouds, a subtle celestial arc suggesting the Qixi magpie bridge overhead, elegant stillness.\nCamera: each shot uses a distinct cinematic angle, clean hard cuts, no dissolves, subtle push-ins and a soft orbit on the hand-touch moment, premium live-action motion.\nAudio: rooftop wind, distant city ambience, faint traffic hum, subtle footsteps, low emotional score underneath, a gentle accent hit on the eye-contact beat, fuller score bloom at 4s, then a clean finish.\nNo text, subtitles, logos or watermarks of any kind, no animation or cartoon rendering, no overly-CG look, keep the live-action texture."
			],
